        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Genre:</strong> Third-Person Shooter / Melee Combat / Brawler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this chaotic battlefield, you are not the only prey—mutant spiders, flamethrower soldiers, berserk axemen… They fight among themselves, yet could tear you apart at any moment. As the lone survivor, your only goal is simple: <strong>stay alive as long as possible</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies also fight each other, creating ever-changing situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-range machine guns excel at distant targets, while shotguns unleash devastating power up close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of ammo, draw your machete and clash with enemies head-on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy turrets to suppress enemies, or teleport to escape danger and break through desperate situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for mysterious crates scattered across the battlefield to obtain powerful items that keep you alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> – Teleport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong> – Use Medkit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G</strong> – Throw Grenade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E</strong> – Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W, A, S, D</strong> – Move</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Genre:</strong> Third-Person Shooter / Melee Combat / Brawler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On this chaotic battlefield, you are not the only prey—mutant spiders, flamethrower soldiers, berserk axemen… They fight among themselves, yet could tear you apart at any moment. As the lone survivor, your only goal is simple: <strong>stay alive as long as possible</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies also fight each other, creating ever-changing situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long-range machine guns excel at distant targets, while shotguns unleash devastating power up close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you run out of ammo, draw your machete and clash with enemies head-on.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy turrets to suppress enemies, or teleport to escape danger and break through desperate situations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for mysterious crates scattered across the battlefield to obtain powerful items that keep you alive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space</strong> – Teleport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong> – Use Medkit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>G</strong> – Throw Grenade</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>E</strong> – Interact</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>W, A, S, D</strong> – Move</p></li></ul>",
